  {
   "type": "cols",
   "layout": "33-66",
   "columns": [
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "<h1> 选项与配件 </h1>",
      "body": "",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c1994",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "accordion",
      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "title": "站立式工作站",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>»pomBasic« 检测设备作为站立式工作站，结构稳固且定位稳妥。配备可伸缩的鼠标和键盘托盘。</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/0/e/csm_option_tisch_59_536b12161b.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1993",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "坐式工作站",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>»pomBasic« 检测设备采用结构稳固且定位精准的设计，作为坐式工作站，即使在进行耗时较长的检测任务时也能提供最佳舒适度。配备可伸缩的鼠标和键盘托盘。</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/d/f/csm_option_sitzplatz_b2fbd33b41.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1991",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "辅助照明",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>通过LED平板照明实现周边区域的透射光测量。照明光源直接与视频显微镜系统相对布置，从而可测量外轮廓、台阶长度、尖角角度等更多参数。<br/><br/>配备»pomColorCam«光学系统的»pomBasic«附加白光照明；»pomBasic MTI«附加红光照明</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/f/5/csm_option_diffusor_1a0262860e.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1989",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "»pomLightTube«（白/红）",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>高度可调的辅助照明，可在进行径向和轴向入射光测量时，为刀具刃口沿线的最小区域提供最佳的高对比度照明。</p> <p>白色/红色LED光：适用于带 »pomLightTube«的 »pomBasic« 。蓝色LED光：适用于带»pomMicroLightTube«的 »pomBasic MTI«。</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/7/e/csm_option_pomlighttube_5dc57c1907.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1987",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "单点LED光源（白光/红光）",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>可调光 LED 点光源可根据刀具位置灵活调整，即使对带倒角的几何结构也能进行最佳照明。 </p> <p>白色 LED 光：适用于配备 »pomColorCam« 光学系统的 »pomBasic«。红色 LED 光：适用于配备 »pomCam« 和 »pomBasic MTI« 光学系统的»pomBasic« </p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/0/a/csm_option_led-spotbeleuchtung_2176f457a4.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1985",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "图纸架",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>适用于在测量位置就近放置图纸。磁性球头关节使操作人员可灵活调整至最佳视角。图纸可通过磁吸方式轻松固定，更换也非常快捷。</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/2/6/csm_option_zeichnungshalterung_dce3bb4436.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 682
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1983",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "刀具/配件托盘",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>检测设备左侧的置物架可安全存放最大柄径为50毫米的刀具。此外，置物架还为小零件和可转位刀片提供了充足的存放空间。</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/4/c/csm_option_werkzeugablage_a942acc1be.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 646
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1981",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "加长式旋转工作台",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>适用于直径 3 mm 至 20 mm、长度可达 1000 mm 的超长刀具。支撑棱柱的高度可调。与延长旋转台之间采用机械连接方式。</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/c/7/csm_option_schwenktisch_5be30c1285.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1979",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "深孔钻头的加长钻头",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>适用于直径3毫米至20毫米、长度不超过1000毫米的超长刀具。棱镜的支撑高度可调节。与延长旋转工作台的连接采用机械连接方式。</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/f/9/csm_option_aufnahme_tischlochbohrer_28f38c0faf.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1996",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
